<item><title>Cameroon&apos;s minister orders mayors to issue birth certificates to election candidates</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-s-minister-orders-mayors-to-issue-birth-edf4b2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-s-minister-orders-mayors-to-issue-birth-edf4b2/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>Georges Elanga Obam says refusing the documents or charging fees for them taints the electoral contest, and the rule is that they are free.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:10:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-s-minister-orders-mayors-to-issue-birth-edf4b2/share.jpg" length="44410" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-s-minister-orders-mayors-to-issue-birth-edf4b2/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cameroon&apos;s chamber seeks processing partnerships and more reliable power</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-s-chamber-seeks-processing-partnerships-and-more-0d2866/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-s-chamber-seeks-processing-partnerships-and-more-0d2866/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>At a Yaounde forum, the chamber also urged clearer approval timelines and regulatory rules to help firms assess investment risks.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 05:57:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" length="34085" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
