<item><title>Cameroon cancels two tenders for tax-system infrastructure</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-cancels-two-tenders-for-tax-system-infrastructure-900050/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-cancels-two-tenders-for-tax-system-infrastructure-900050/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>The €15 million German-funded programme is left without suppliers for equipment and connectivity after no bids met minimum requirements.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:52:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" length="34085" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
